{
  "name": "@local/dsh-copy-markdown",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "description": "Copy a transcript selection as Markdown source: literal prose is escaped, formulas come back as $TeX$ (or, for a partial selection, as the reconstructed source of just that part), code blocks as fences, tables as GFM tables, diff cards as ```diff, terminals as fences, footnotes as [^n] + definitions.",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "deepseek",
    "dsh",
    "cordis",
    "markdown",
    "clipboard",
    "copy",
    "katex",
    "latex",
    "gfm",
    "chat-ui",
    "web-ui",
    "plugin"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Rayzenchen/dsh-copy-markdown.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Rayzenchen/dsh-copy-markdown#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Rayzenchen/dsh-copy-markdown/issues"
  },
  "engines": {
    "dsh": ">=0.2.2-rc.3 <0.3.0",
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "meta": {
    "title": "复制增强",
    "description": "在对话记录里选中内容按 Cmd/Ctrl+C 时，复制的是它的 Markdown 源码：公式还原成 $TeX$、代码块还原成围栏、表格还原成 GFM 表格、diff 卡还原成 ```diff、终端块还原成围栏、脚注还原成 [^n] + 定义；正文里字面出现的 Markdown 语法会被转义，只选中公式的一部分时给出那一部分的重建源码。同时向其它插件提供 markdownSource 服务。"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "tools/*.mjs",
    "docs",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "devDependencies": {
    "jsdom": "^29.1.1",
    "katex": "0.16.47"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-conversation",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-chat"
      ]
    }
  }
}
